    {id:'tb-m4-s3-i3',difficulty:'medium',
     q:'You want to highlight the top 10 products dynamically so membership updates as data changes. Group or Set?',
     options:['Group — groups can be defined with a Top N condition','Set — sets support dynamic conditions (Top N by field value) that automatically update membership','Either — both support dynamic Top N conditions','Neither — use a calculated field with RANK() instead'],
     correctIndex:1,explanation:'Only Sets support dynamic membership via Top N or condition rules that auto-update. Groups are always static.'},
    {id:'tb-m4-s3-i4',difficulty:'hard',
     q:'What is the key difference between using a Set on the Filters shelf vs the Color card?',
     options:['Filters shelf removes OUT members from the view entirely; Color card shows all members but colour-codes them as IN or OUT','Filters shelf shows only IN members; Color card shows only OUT members','Both produce identical results','Color card filtering requires a Set Action; Filters shelf does not'],
     correctIndex:0,explanation:'Filters shelf: only IN members appear (OUT hidden). Color card: all members shown, IN vs OUT colour-coded — no data removed.'}
